# Alt+F4 refused, LbaWinSettings: 210, 0x40 set
# (fixtures/outside: the CD's LBA.CFG and the outside save). The kept
# Xephyr runs no window manager, so the keys reach the port: Alt+F4
# leaves the game going, F4 kept out of its input with its release,
# and Twinsen keeps his normal behaviour. F2 then makes him sporty.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
hold 0.15
sleep 12
shot start
key alt+F4
sleep 2
shot altf4
key F2
sleep 2
shot sporty
